# harness / editor local state
.claude/

# lem-materialized dependencies + build output (regenerable via `lem restore` / `lem pack`)
**/deps/
**/*-lib/
**/*.doo
**/.lem-publish/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# diagnostic / profiling output
**/*.csv

# build artifacts left by publish
**/*.zip

# regex-engine is a distinct upstream port (RegElk, EPFL) with its own git repo
# (github.com/hath995/regex-engine); it's a workspace member on disk but tracked
# separately, not absorbed into this monorepo.
regex-engine/
